  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.name": "初唐明光铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.0.text": "初唐明光铠，乃唐初明光甲之形制。可于甲冶锻台，取甲片、甲坯与诸材合铸；亦可用对应锻灵石升造，详参材料篇·锻灵石。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.1.text": "此铠可采铁、金、金刚、玄鈺四材造之，今以铁制为例述其功用。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套此铠遭击，有二成之机率令敌兵兵器偃息四息；未具全套，触发机率亦为二成。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.early_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.3.text": "全铠在身，箭矢无伤，且可反弹来矢；行速增两成。若乘兽，坐骑得坚肤Ⅱ、疾行Ⅱ、生息之效。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.text": "上图为此铠形制。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.text": "上图为此兵形制。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.name": "中唐明光铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.0.text": "中唐明光铠，明光甲中期之式。可于甲冶锻台，取甲片、甲坯与诸材合铸；亦可用对应锻灵石升造，详参材料篇·锻灵石。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.1.text": "此铠可采铁、金、金刚、玄鈺四材造之，今以铁制为例述其功用。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭剑、三叉戟所击，六成机率减四成创痛；未集全铠，机率降为三成。全铠可御箭矢，反弹来矢。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.middle_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.3.text": "身着全套，奔走之速增两成；乘兽之时，坐骑得坚肤Ⅱ、疾行Ⅱ、生息Ⅱ。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.name": "晚唐明光铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.0.text": "晚唐明光铠，明光甲晚世之式。可于甲冶锻台，取甲片、甲坯与诸材合铸；亦可用对应锻灵石升造，详参材料篇·锻灵石。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.1.text": "此铠可采铁、金、金刚、玄鈺四材造之，今以铁制为例述其功用。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭剑、三叉戟所击，六成机率减四成创痛；未集全铠，机率降为三成。全铠可御箭矢，反弹来矢。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.late_tang_dynasty_ming_guang_armor.pages.3.text": "身着全套，奔走之速增两成；乘兽之时，坐骑得坚肤Ⅱ、疾行Ⅲ、腾跃Ⅱ。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.name": "步人铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.pages.0.text": "步人铠，宋世重步之甲。可于甲冶锻台，取甲片、甲坯与诸材合铸；亦可用对应锻灵石升造，详参材料篇·锻灵石。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.pages.1.text": "此铠可采铁、金、金刚、玄鈺四材造之，今以铁制为例述其功用。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.pages.2.text": "全套在身，奔走之速减两成五分。具全铠则有冲撞、死冲二能；疾奔可撞飞周遭生灵，损其一气，掀之二丈，每撞一兽耗一腹饱。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.footmen_armor.pages.3.text": "自身气血不足两成，恒得雄力Ⅱ、御创Ⅱ、迅疾Ⅲ。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.name": "山文铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.pages.0.text": "山文铠，中土特色札甲。可于甲冶锻台，取甲片、甲坯与诸材合铸；亦可用对应锻灵石升造，详参材料篇·锻灵石。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.pages.1.text": "此铠可采铁、金、金刚、玄鈺四材造之，今以铁制为例述其功用。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭剑、三叉戟击，三成机率减两成创痛；未集全铠，机率降为一成。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.mountain_character_armor.pages.3.text": "自高坠下，离地三丈，自动得缓坠之效。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.name": "唐步卒铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.pages.0.text": "唐步卒铠，唐寻常步卒之护具。可于甲冶锻台，取甲片、甲坯与诸材合铸；亦可用对应锻灵石升造，详参材料篇·锻灵石。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.pages.1.text": "此铠可采铁、金、金刚、玄鈺四材造之，今以铁制为例述其功用。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.pages.2.text": "铁制唐步卒铠未有异能，防护与寻常铁铠无异。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.tang_dynasty_infantry_armor.pages.3.text": "后续奇能，敬候更新。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.name": "细鳞铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.pages.0.text": "细鳞铠，轻便护具。可于甲冶锻台，取甲片、甲坯与诸材合铸；亦可用对应锻灵石升造，详参材料篇·锻灵石。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.pages.1.text": "此铠可采铁、金、金刚、玄鈺四材造之，今以铁制为例述其功用。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭剑、三叉戟击，三成机率减两成创痛；未集全铠，机率降为一成。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.fine_scale_armor.pages.3.text": "身着此铠，不惧甜莓刺创，亦能免方天画戟牵曳之术。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.name": "乌锤铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.pages.0.text": "乌锤铠，厚重护铠。可于甲冶锻台，取甲片、甲坯与诸材合铸；亦可用对应锻灵石升造，详参材料篇·锻灵石。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.pages.1.text": "此铠可采铁、金、金刚、玄鈺四材造之，今以铁制为例述其功用。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.pages.2.text": "身披全套，遭剑、三叉戟击，六成机率减四成创痛；未集全铠，机率降为三成。遇重锤下击，可减半创痛，非全套亦有效，触发机率五成。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.black_chui_armor.pages.3.text": "全套在身，三成机率反还五成创痛于敌；未集全铠，机率一成。全套遭击，四成机率令敌兵兵器偃息三息，未集全铠则为二成。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.weapons.name": "兵械",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.glaive.name": "偃月刀",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.glaive.pages.0.text": "偃月刀，长柄利刃。击敌八成机率令其血溢五息；潜行右击可旋斩，伤增二分，每斩耗一腹饱。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.glaive.pages.1.text": "偃月刀可采木、石、金、铁、金刚、玄鈺铸之；亦可以铁偃月刀合太古灵璞，锻青龙偃月刀。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.dagger_axe.name": "戈",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.dagger_axe.pages.0.text": "戈，先秦长柄勾啄之器。右击猛勾，可牵无坐骑之敌至身前，损其二气；",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.dagger_axe.pages.1.text": "若敌乘兽，三成机率掀其下鞍，此击耗戈一分坚利。寻常刺击八成机率令敌裂创五息。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.sky_piercing_halberd.name": "方天画戟",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.sky_piercing_halberd.pages.0.text": "方天画戟，重型长柄神兵，有横斩、牵马二技。潜行挥击则横斩，掀敌二丈，血溢五息；乘兽挥击则牵马，",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.sky_piercing_halberd.pages.1.text": "敌无坐骑，则强牵随行五息，彼不能攻走，唯可腾跃，每跃三成机率脱缚，同时身中裂创五息。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.weapons.description": "诸兵之用法与异能",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.materials.name": "材料",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.materials.description": "诸般造甲之材",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.forging_stone.name": "锻灵石",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.forging_stone.pages.0.text": "锻灵石，取诸般山石合石英锻成，如花冈、闪长之属；不同山石得对应铠之锻灵石。置寻常铠与锻灵石于锻台，可铸本模奇铠。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.armor_pieces.name": "甲片&甲坯",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.armor_pieces.pages.0.text": "甲片可合为甲坯，用以铸多数铠胄",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.materials.armor_pieces.pages.1.text": "山文甲片可合山文甲坯，专铸山文铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.other.name": "杂记",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.categories.other.description": "制模相关纪事",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.other.mainfest.pages.1.text": "§l华夏甲兵襄助名录：$(br)§r星屹工作室（CTN STUDIO）-主事，sf.-编码，末影洁-编码，Xiris-造模绘像，星零大队长-绘像，小史龙吖（Slime_Dragon）-绘像，Призмарин-俄译，方漓猫-基岩版移植$(br)§l鸣谢§r：$(br)spake404-代码辅持，BaiGave-代码辅持，阳炎-献策，叹息之塔-吉祥物。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.other.mainfest.pages.0.text": "此制由星屹工作室主持打造，论道群：1102108787",
