  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.suanni_helmet.name": "狻猊兜鍪",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.bohai_helmet.name": "渤海帽",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.armor.bohai_helmet.pages.0.text": "可代明光兜鍪，披全幅明光甲之时，亦引全套甲胄之威能。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.tang_dynasty_heng_saber.name": "横刀",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.tang_dynasty_heng_saber.pages.0.text": "横刀者，唐兵也。执而右击，则伤人之数为本器攻伐之力再加二分。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.tang_dynasty_heng_saber.pages.1.text": "异效良多，静待增补。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.tang_dynasty_horse_armor.name": "唐世马铠",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.tang_dynasty_horse_armor.pages.0.text": "唐马铠披于驹马，可增其捍御之能。",
  "patchouli.chineseweapons.book.entries.weapons.tang_dynasty_horse_armor.pages.1.text": "马覆此铠，则箭矢不能伤之。"
